WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.816
Your marketing should sound like their mouth, not your brand workshop.

00:00:03.816 --> 00:00:06.244
This lesson is about buyer language library.

00:00:06.244 --> 00:00:07.979
Reuse their words in offers.

00:00:07.979 --> 00:00:10.407
Do not treat this as theory only.

00:00:10.407 --> 00:00:13.876
Treat it as a move you can run this week.

00:00:13.876 --> 00:00:19.080
By the end, you should be able to act without waiting for a perfect plan.

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:22.896
Keep the DigProg habit: watch, practice, then take one real action.

00:00:22.896 --> 00:00:26.712
Stay practical: collect 10 phrases before you optimize branding or tools.

00:00:27.032 --> 00:00:30.243
